[That] they bear [this office] and hold [it], and [that] they and theirs obey you as [they would] Ours;

[That they] obey, comply, respond, and attend [to you], just as to other [holders of the] place of Bailiff they are [bound] to obey, comply, respond, and attend;

And [that they] act, present [themselves], and not do, say, or oppose [anything] for any cause or in any testimony whatsoever.

